# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
title    Swamp
composer Claude
about    Glowing caps over acid pools: a lazy, swung walk in G minor with seventh chords, an oboe tune and a bassoon creeping along under it, a marimba bubbling up through the chords and a fretless bass that slides into its fifths. When something is near, conga, tumba and guiro take over; a horn and brass join the fight, a low choir and gong come for a guardian.
tempo    84
beats    4
steps    4
swing    0.2
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead bassoon marimba bass pad
# mood treasure: marimba pad wonder
# mood sense:    conga tumba guiro bass pad
# mood rise:     sense lead marimba kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -guiro -marimba -tumba horn brass drive war crash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     oboe      vol=0.55 pan=-0.1
voice horn     horn      vol=0.65  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3
voice bassoon  bassoon   vol=0.4  pan=0.25
voice marimba  marimba   vol=0.5  pan=-0.4
voice bass     fretless  vol=0.7  glide=0.12
voice pad      strings   vol=0.22 pan=0.3  center=Bb3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice wonder   celesta   vol=0.38 pan=-0.3 rev=0.6
voice conga    conga     vol=0.45 pan=0.3
voice tumba    tumba     vol=0.5  pan=-0.2
voice guiro    guiro     vol=0.18 pan=0.4
voice kick     kick      vol=0.55
voice snare    snare     vol=0.38 pan=0.1
voice brass    brass     vol=0.42 pan=-0.25 gate=0.65 center=Bb3 att=0.018 rel=0.09 rev=0.22
voice crash    crash     vol=0.28 pan=0.2
voice choir    voices    vol=0.3  center=G3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong      vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

# Combat-only motion: tight low ostinato and accented battle drums, at the same tempo.
voice drive    marimba   vol=0.55 pan=-0.4 gate=0.55 rev=0.2
voice war      tommid    vol=0.5  pan=-0.15 rev=0.2

